    {
      "id": "p0241-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This scene has two important elements to it. First, it contains an \"extreme tonal shift\", as Toby puts it. Second, the scene is an indirect reference to a popular quote from EarthBound:",
        "raw": "This scene has two important elements to it. First, it contains an \"extreme\ntonal shift\", as Toby puts it. Second, the scene is an indirect reference to a\npopular quote from EarthBound:",
        "status": "corrected",
