    {
      "id": "p0241-b010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Unfortunately, the original Japanese version of this EarthBound quote is spoken by a cranky, middle-aged police chief with a different speech pattern than Sans', so the translator was forced to adjust the quote to match Sans' character. Thus, Toby's EarthBound reference still lives on in the Japanese script, just in a less recognizable form.",
        "raw": "Unfortunately, the original Japanese version of this EarthBound quote is\nspoken by a cranky, middle-aged police chief with a different speech pattern\nthan Sans', so the translator was forced to adjust the quote to match Sans'\ncharacter. Thus, Toby's EarthBound reference still lives on in the Japanese\nscript, just in a less recognizable form.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.10128655,
          0.70426429,
          0.67833001,
          0.78949286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09769361,
          0.70355,
          0.70038077,
          0.79056429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          30,
          31,
          32,
          33,
          34
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "可惜，日文原句是个脾气暴躁的中年警察局长说的，语气和 Sans 不同。译者只好调整措辞，让它符合 Sans 的性格。因此，日文剧本仍保留了 Toby 对《EarthBound》的致敬，只是没那么容易认出来。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
