    {
      "id": "p0241-b011",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "Sans has many intimidating lines during this scene in the game. What's more, most players probably end up seeing this scene dozens of times before defeating Sans. So it's no surprise that this section of the game is where some imprinted fan-translation players criticize the official translation the most, and vice-versa.",
        "raw": "Sans has many intimidating lines during this scene in the game. What's\nmore, most players probably end up seeing this scene dozens of times\nbefore defeating Sans. So it's no surprise that this section of the game\nis where some imprinted fan-translation players criticize the official\ntranslation the most, and vice-versa.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.12017713,
          0.81803571,
          0.64827818,
          0.89107857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.11886878,
          0.81732143,
          0.64958653,
          0.89215
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          35,
          36,
          37,
          38,
          39
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Sans 在这个场景里有许多气势逼人的台词。多数玩家打败他之前，大概还得看上几十遍。因此，这一段往往是先入为主的民间译本玩家批评官译最多的地方；先接触官译的玩家也会反过来批评民间译本，并不奇怪。",
        "status": "draft",
